<p class=3D"x_MsoNormal" style=3D"margin-bottom:8.0pt; text-indent:.5in; li=
ne-height:106%">
<span style=3D"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">This is your rem=
inder that Host Orientation is tomorrow, Thursday, January 2 at 1:00PM at t=
he Umpqua Lighthouse State Park office. For those of you coming in this mon=
th, I hope you are excited to start your host
 assignments! This month we have two hosts who are new to our MU, three ret=
urning hosts, and eight hosts who are continuing assignments from last mont=
h. We also have two hosts joining us for their first ever assignments with =
Oregon State Parks.</span></p>
<p class=3D"x_MsoNormal" style=3D"margin-bottom:8.0pt; text-indent:.5in; li=
ne-height:106%">
<span style=3D"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">Hosts who were h=
ere last month do not need to attend orientation again, but are encouraged =
to come meet everyone and hear announcements. You do not need to bring anyt=
hing to orientation. We will have water, fresh
 tea and coffee, and maybe a few snacks. Remember to log orientation and tr=
aining on your volunteer timesheets.
</span></p>
